				Price="500"
				UnlockByExploration="false"
				UnlockByRank="1"
			>
				<UiDesc 
				UiDesc="Specialized tire set. The ultimate weapon against the deepest of marshes, providing the best off-road performance at the cost of on-road traction. Friction (Body/Asphalt/Substance): 1.25 / 0.35 / 2.5. Wheel softness: Soft." 
